.SH BUGS
The original fires missiles with Ctrl+Left and Ctrl+Right from its
pull-down menu; Inferno's keyboard interface does not distinguish
Ctrl-modified arrows, so the missiles moved to
.B z
and
.BR x ,
and there is no menu.
Unit walk cycles play the original's four mesh keyframes at the
original rates but are not interpolated between frames, and facing
angles are quantized to 16 directions.
